meta {
  name: List Registrants
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/oprec-staff
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  page_size: 10
  ~search: 
  ~status: pending
  ~faculty_id: 
  ~department_id: 
  ~division_id: 
  ~subdivision_id: 
  ~choice_priority: all
  ~batch: 2025
  ~sort_by: created_at
  ~sort: desc
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  Daftar pendaftar. Admin divisi hanya melihat pendaftar divisinya.

  | Query | Keterangan |
  |---|---|
  | `page`, `page_size` | default 1 dan 10 (`take` = nama lama `page_size`) |
  | `search` | nama, NRP, atau email |
  | `status` | salah satu status pendaftar |
  | `faculty_id`, `department_id`, `division_id`, `subdivision_id` | UUID |
  | `choice_priority` | `1`, `2`, atau `all`; butuh `division_id` atau `subdivision_id` |
  | `batch` | tahun angkatan |
  | `sort_by` | `created_at`, `name`, `nrp`, `status` |
  | `sort` | `asc` atau `desc` |

  `meta` berisi `page`, `page_size`, `total_items`, `total_pages`.
}
